ALVA — Implement New Stage: Jökull

Objective

Implement a complete, fully playable fifth stage named Jökull in the existing Alva game.

Repository: hiyroscript/alva

Jökull is a frozen, snow-covered arena built from one enormous glacier-like block of ice. Its defining mechanic is that the apparent single platform actually consists of three perfectly connected sections.

The centre section is permanently indestructible. The left and right sections independently accumulate structural damage whenever fighters land on or newly enter them. After approximately 15 qualifying landings per section, that section dramatically fractures, breaks away, and falls into the abyss permanently for the remainder of the match.

The stage also features a 25% random blizzard event, creating a temporary whiteout that significantly reduces visibility.

Both the destructible ice sections and blizzards are official stage hazards.

This must be a fully implemented stage, not a mockup, prototype, or visual-only addition.

